WEBVTT

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.730
Cheers to the Shining Future!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:07.770
Aoba Central Hospital

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:20.100
Melon...

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.630
Melon.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.820
Have you come to, Daichi-kun?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.330
I received a report from my subordinate who carried you in.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.020
We lost Melon-san to the unidentified Akikan...

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:58.020
Where do you plan on going?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.490
I understand your feelings.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:05.620
But, when facing the most powerful Akikan, what do you think you can do on your own?!

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:06.790
Daichi-kun?

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.400
I'm about to piss myself!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.110
Ah, I feel so much better!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.550
Thanks for holding that for me!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.600
Ah, I forgot to wash my hands.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.120
Wh-What the hell is wrong with you?!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.690
Well then, now that I've relieved myself.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.220
Wait just a minute!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.470
Listen to me—

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.670
Please tell me.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.240
Where is she?

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:44.990
You know, don't you?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.910
I'm talking about that Mixed Juice Akikan.

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:52.770
About that... After what happened, we have been keeping her under 24-hour surveillance.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.070
But...

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.330
I have it, y'know.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.860
A sure-fire strategy to win against her.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:01.970
Kakeru-chan!

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:14.420
Budoko... Come back to me.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.480
Let's play together.

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.970
Hey! Hey! Hurry it up, Airin-chan!

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:40.030
It's Kizaki.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.050
If you don't hurry, she'll get away!

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:45.410
Is what you said earlier true?

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.730
That you have a plan to defeat that Akikan?

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.200
Hey, over there!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.920
Catch up, Airin-chan!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:52.970
It's Kizaki!

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:56.270
Hey, wait up, sweetheart!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.270
You guys.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:01.630
If you don't mind, won't you come with me for tea?

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:05.940
Let's have lunch in at a cafe in a chic town, and an angry fever go-go until morning!

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.790
I like that hot side of you, baby! Woohoo!

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.160
You sure are interesting, aren't you?

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.670
So come on, hang out with me just a bit more!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.330
Hey wait! Wait up!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:24.670
My hard friend is pulling a disappearing act!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.510
That's not true!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.440
Kakeru-chan is always strong!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.850
What the hell are you saying?!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.860
Mix it, mix it, mix it well.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.770
Rainbow Crash Mixer!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.020
You sure are stubborn.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.610
Do you guys really want to be blown away?!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.010
Now you've done it.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.400
We've caught you, Mixed Juice Akikan.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.130
I don't get it.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:18.390
Why would you chase after me?

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:19.870
Your Akikan is—

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.440
She hasn't disappeared yet!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.520
You said it, right?

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:26.530
That you mixed the powers of other Akikans.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.320
Melon is still inside of you!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:30.950
Huh?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.240
So what?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.650
Do you think you can actually beat me?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.280
Kakeru-chan.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.770
He has a plan.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.900
We have no choice but to count on him.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:44.850
I beg you.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.770
Please return Melon, Yell, and the others.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.180
Kakeru-chan.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.590
This is his plan?

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.670
That can't be!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.300
Are you making a fool out of me?

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.880
I don't know any other way to do this!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.600
Even you must understand, right?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:03.110
The feeling of an Owner who has lost their Akikan!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.500
Because of that, you cannot...

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.700
Unfortunately, I don't understand.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:13.500
Your feelings as an Owner.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.230
I'm done.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.040
I'll leave you to her.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.360
Come on out, Melon Zero.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.090
It can't be...

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:36.390
Melon-chan?!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.560
No, that's an impostor she created by absorbing Melon-san.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.460
Zero-domo always uses divine punishment,

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.760
in order to know her enemy's powers.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.970
Do it, Melon Zero.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.000
Kakeru-chan!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.550
How is it?

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.880
Doesn't it feel good?

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.510
To get done in by the Akikan you hold dear?

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:16.940
Everyone is my enemy!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:20.520
Akikans and the Owners who love their Akikans!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:26.040
Wait, why do... you hate Akikans so much?

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.390
You're no different from Melon—

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:30.860
Shut up already!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.250
I'm nothing like those useless Akikans!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.410
I am the strongest Akikan!

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.490
Finish him off, Melon Zero.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.750
Kakeru-chan!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.980
What's the matter?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.050
Didn't I tell you to finish him off?

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:56.820
Why?

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.380
Why won't you listen to me?

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.770
Zero doesn't have a heart.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.590
She's merely a shell that possesses Melon's power!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.630
Then there's only one answer to that.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.230
What?

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.070
You stopped her.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.690
No, it was Melon who did it from within you!

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.150
That's foolishness!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.830
It can't be!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.710
She was mixed inside of me!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.710
Come back to me, Melon!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.240
Your home is here.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:30.750
Next to me, right?

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.550
What... is this?

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.040
Melon!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.170
Kakeru...

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.090
What is this?!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.610
Come, Melon!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.360
I will... I will!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.960
I will love you!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.860
Melon!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.140
Kakeru... I...

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:21.440
You finally came back.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.030
If we're not together, we can't play catchball, can we?

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.420
Kakeru?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:28.300
It can't be...

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.940
The power I stole...

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.030
I've been waiting for this chance.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.270
What are you doing?!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.200
Otoya-san! You're okay!

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.280
We'll talk about it later.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:47.720
Najimi-kun.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:50.330
Yell!

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.120
Misaki-kun!

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.670
Budoko!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.660
Misaki-san, why are you here?

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.310
Otoya-san brought me with him.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:01.760
He said that in order to save Budoko, my power would be necessary.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:05.080
Now, this is the time for us to make our wish!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:11.150
Let your hearts join with those of your Akikan and our wishes will surely reach them.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.250
Turn back into your old self, Yell!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:19.300
Let's play together again, Budoko.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.660
Please!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.110
O-Owner!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:35.010
Yell!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.780
Mishaki!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:38.460
Budoko!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.800
You did it, you guys!

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.210
Yes!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.690
What?!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.970
What?!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.370
Those are the Zeros!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:14.100
Over here too.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.830
Just how many Akikans' powers has she stolen?!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.430
I'm done with stealing powers.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.640
Let's get to it, shall we?

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.340
Akikan Elect.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:26.880
I refuse!

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:27.770
Huh?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.770
I have no intention of fighting with you.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.810
Are you trying to thoroughly make a fool of me?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.660
But, if you say there's no other choice...

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.020
I'll use my full power to bring you to your senses!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.100
Let's do it, Melon!

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.010
Yes!

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.620
Yell, please!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:44.180
Yes!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.300
Budoko!

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.210
Yup!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.400
Let's go!

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.440
Gulp!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.070
It's time to finish this!

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.160
Yes!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:23.990
Okay!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.240
Get them!

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:32.040
Mero-mero Melon!

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.420
Isotonic Sword!

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:41.400
Sour Grapes!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:45.130
Take that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that!

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.750
What?!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.700
Didn't I say,

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.970
an impostor without a heart is no challenge!

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.510
Shit!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.460
Don't get full of yourself!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.830
I won't be done in by someone who's being pampered by their owner!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:05.400
No... No... I'm the strongest!

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.660
How's that?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.960
That's the definitive Mixed Juice, created by mixing various juices.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.920
The Mixed Juice can is the best can there is!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.090
Yell, Budoko.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.930
I don't want to say it, but we need to combine our strengths.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.640
We're about to show you...

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.480
The most powerful and precious power!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.690
Mero-mero Melon!

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:49.440
Sour Grapes!

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.200
Isotonic Sword!

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:03.340
Mero-mero...

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:04.810
It can't be!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:06.830
How could I lose to them?

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.200
Melon!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.620
I am... I am... the greatest...

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.960
This is our power.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.040
What makes <i>you</i> so great?

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:35.060
You're strong just because you mix a ton of juices together?!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.830
There's no way that's true!

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:38.410
What?!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:43.230
If you mix together all that you can find, what you get is no longer drinkable.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:50.260
I... can't lose... to an Akikan like you...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.880
Alright, well done!

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:54.420
Kakeru!

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:56.970
You impressed me, Maron!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:57.620
Huh?

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.880
Alright, let's go home, Colon.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.920
Wait, was it Salon?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.950
Ah, no no no, it could have been Poron.

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:08.810
"Poron" can't be right, since her breasts aren't very—

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:08.810
Translator's Note: "Poron" (ポロン) is the Japanese onomatopoeia for bouncing breasts.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.190
You...

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.320
Bakakeru!

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:19.110
You still haven't changed...

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:23.060
Seriously... you idiot.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:24.710
Yell!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.700
Thank goodness!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:26.780
Owner!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:29.540
Budoko... Budoko!

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.750
D-don't cry, Misaki.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:37.000
Does it pain you to see a scene like this?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.350
You are...

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:42.980
I've done some research on you, the strongest Akikan.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:46.360
No, I really should call you "The Nameless Akikan."

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:47.920
Huh?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.980
She was thrown out by her Owner,

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:52.100
as soon as she appeared as a girl.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:53.980
What?!

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:56.810
Since then, she has lived by herself.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:02.230
All the while, she held a grudge against Akikans who, unlike herself, are loved by their Owners.

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:03.580
So that's how it was.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.420
That's why you sought after all of us indiscriminately, right?

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.110
Otoya-san!

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:11.420
If you had researched all of that, why didn't you say a word to me?

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:15.960
Well, it's cool to make people believe you've been defeated!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.570
In order to deceive your enemies, you must start with your allies.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:19.930
Right, Airin-kun?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:20.760
It's Kizaki.

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.270
I kind of feel sorry for her.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:27.150
No, there is no need for Owner to feel that way.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.220
That's wight, that's wight!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:32.660
'Cuz she caused a lot of trouble for everyone!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.050
B-Budoko!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:39.260
Hey, what kind of guy was the Owner who threw you away?

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:44.450
It was... a cold night...

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.560
Nice to meet you, Owner.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.690
That was the last time I saw my Owner.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.970
A cat?!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.100
Is that kind of thing even possible?

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:20.710
Hmm... Well, it's decidedly a rare case, but...

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.490
I was thrown away!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.150
Without even receiving a name!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:26.630
I was abandoned by my Owner!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.490
No, no, it was a cat...

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:31.120
It can't be helped that you were thrown away without receiving a name.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:35.780
Furthermore, don't you think he was frightened and ran off, instead of throwing you away?

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.220
Shut the hell up!

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.250
Just as I thought, none of you understand a bit about how I feel!

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.060
What the hell? Do you still want to go at it?

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.610
Of course!

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:46.390
I'm the best!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.840
It doesn't matter if I don't have a name!

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:52.020
I've decided!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.890
Your name is...

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:55.930
Mazeko!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.070
Huh?!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.760
I got it from "Mix Juice", so Mazeko!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.760
Translator's Note: "mazeru" (混ぜる) means "to mix", and "ko" (子) is a common ending for a female name

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.330
How about it? Isn't it a nice name?

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.500
Your name is Mazeko from now on—

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.150
What does "Mazeko" mean?!

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.970
Th-That's such a weird name...

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:09.730
Miku!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.550
The "Miku" part of "mikkusu jusu!"

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.000
How about that?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.270
Miku?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:16.880
Yes.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.090
That's your name.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.510
My name... is Miku...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.480
If you don't have an Owner,

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:27.310
and if you're so jealous of Melon and the others, and nothing can be done about it,

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.810
then I'll become your Owner.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.730
I'll treat you lovingly.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.910
Is that okay, Miku?

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.110
Kakeru-chan!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.110
Kakeru!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:45.130
Why the hell are you taking advantage of the situation?!

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:48.100
That's right! You're crossing the line!

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.730
You idiots! It can't be helped!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:54.530
I was honestly and purely only thinking about the best thing to do for Miku's sake—

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:55.560
Is that true?!

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:56.230
Well...

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.630
Really?

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.050
That is...

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:02.110
...the truth.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.930
You're a liar!

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.380
He's getting away!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.850
Owner, I'll help you too!

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.340
He's a real dummy-dumb, huh?

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.010
Don't say that...

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:16.530
What's this? What's wrong with them?

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:17.350
Mazeko-kun!

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.900
Who the hell is Mazeko?!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.350
Ah, pardon me, Miku-kun.

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:24.280
I-It's not like I've accepted that name...

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:27.620
Owner!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.920
I see, that's how it is.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.400
No, I'm surprised.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:36.660
While I was observing Kakeru and the others, I ran into a cat that looked just like the one in the info sheet.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.790
Which means... In that town...?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.510
How about being obedient, Maze— I mean, Miku-kun.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:46.410
Even if it's not a human, it's your Owner, right?

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.270
Owner!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.840
Owner!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.650
With this, surely she will behave herself.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.220
Bakakeru!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.520
Oh! Now, come to me, Kakeru-kun!

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.860
I'll be your adult partner!

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:09.300
You really are a handful...

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:11.040
We're going back, Otoya-san.

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:19.000
Bakakeru, I won't forgive you the next time you do something idiotic!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.140
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:22.000
Say "yes" properly!

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.100
Yes!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.040
He's like an idiot!

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.390
Otoya-san.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:35.520
Otoya-san, please help me out here.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:41.860
M
A
N

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:41.860
lover

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:52.580
Yay! It's complete!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.160
It's wonderful, Owner!

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.200
I wonder if everyone will be happy?

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.040
Yes!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.410
I won't go.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.600
Budoko...

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:11.360
Well, only if Misaki says so, no matter what...

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:12.630
Budoko!

00:22:20.140 --> 00:22:22.100
Today, I'll say it!

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:23.520
Kochikaze-san!

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:24.860
I like—

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.570
Hey, wait up!

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:29.460
Kochikaze-san...

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:30.660
Yuriri!

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:34.390
Najimi!

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:36.390
What happened today, Najimi?

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:38.780
You know what, later today...

00:22:38.780 --> 00:22:39.670
Hello.

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:40.520
Yuusuke-san.

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:44.200
Fire!

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:45.520
It's on!

00:22:46.680 --> 00:22:49.080
You guys sure don't get tired of it, every single day...

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.060
Kakeru-chan!

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:51.600
Huh?

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:57.940
Everyone is here!

00:22:57.940 --> 00:22:58.940
Hey!

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:05.000
You guys!

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:08.390
I'll treat all of you lovingly!
